From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:21:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 43/44] Create VM lifecycle messages from a single event type
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

Replace the per-operation body functions of Vm_message with a variant
type of the VM events for which a message is created, a function
building the body of the message for an event, and a function creating
the message. Message_forwarding now calls Vm_message.create with the
event, and create_vm_message is removed.

The expected bodies in the test are unchanged; only the calls are
adapted.

Signed-off-by: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
---
 ocaml/tests/test_vm_message.ml   |  36 +++---
 ocaml/xapi/message_forwarding.ml |  90 +++----------
 ocaml/xapi/vm_message.ml         | 213 ++++++++++++++-----------------
 ocaml/xapi/vm_message.mli        |  80 ++++--------
 4 files changed, 159 insertions(+), 260 deletions(-)

